@HomeTaskManager.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5251

### Users
GET {{HomeTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Task templates
GET {{HomeTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/task-templates
Accept: application/json

### Assignment engine settings
GET {{HomeTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/settings/assignment-engine
Accept: application/json

### Audit logs
GET {{HomeTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audit-logs
Accept: application/json

